  <item>
    <title>迎新年！东京热血之旅verver哭，哈尔滨楼顶小时代 | DD003</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65c4e27b0847349e0c16aa4d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65c4e27b0847349e0c16aa4d</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 08 Feb 2024 14:17:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【白日饮酒DAYDRINKING】是一个中文闲聊播客，也是用来干杯的下酒菜和同朋友保持联系的借口。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在周末，从夕阳跨越星空喝酒闲聊，记录洗澡时会悄悄溜走的妙想，逃避工作日。用【真心话】自我告解，给下一周设置【大冒险】来调剂干燥的日常。我们尽力回避尖锐，完全不讲大道理，把关注留给任何微小的快乐。希望在周末等你一起干杯，希望人和动物都能和平干杯~</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们是：</span></p><span></span><p><span>三个性格和工种截然不同，酒量参差不齐，但同样爱猫的朋友！</span></p><span></span><p><span>24：aka汪老师，酒量很菜但嘴硬别扭爱喝</span></p><span></span><p><span>考拉：即刻ID考拉茶水间，非典型互联网大厂搬砖人，每天都在期待不上班的日子</span></p><span></span><p><span>小卢：前国企程序员，从国企裸辞后在家全职陪猫猫玩，与考拉为【合法夫妻关系】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="242">04:02</a>: 本次flag！关于我们吃灰的吉他与高达，考拉重新开始画画</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="523">08:43</a>: 迎新年喽！考拉在看箱根驿传排球春高verver哭，24却在楼顶睥睨人群上演北国小时代</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi_e2w38Bl5E2-ybThzzNwBCIY3y.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>取完票遇到垃圾场决战宣传车！</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgWh0Zz-KABYYVQX8iNBEcH1XPjp.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>买遍了所有春高周边</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl9_UKY8MZfb4ANUdH-DN0PkOpUZ.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>赢下四分之一决赛的冠军校！（当时只觉得很厉害）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvBbmKMV_bBPt8uR-5QtNbZtA0EQ.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>24老师睥睨众生的小时代视角</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="871">14:31</a>: 跨年时考拉小卢在和狐狸一起游行，冬日里的夏目友人帐</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuCDulRFFQEvEZ1AlHjBNhuYdDVg.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>到处吓小孩儿的鬼</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj4KBy_cxiIf5GozdJEkvTlLC1xj.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>巨大的狐狸面具</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiqopdQtMJOqNvfsOkKURvAw7f3W.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>装扮精致氛围感拉满的小哥</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1281">21:21</a>: 东京夜生活非典型版！本以为是纸醉金迷夜夜笙歌结果是脱口秀开放麦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1481">24:41</a>: i人社交好努力！社交场合对我们来说就是试炼场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1892">31:32</a>: 所以到底为什么考拉是不良女大小卢是纯情男高啊！ 新年主打一个随喜赞叹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2055">34:15</a>: 尔滨传统异能！24在冰面上被漂移到连连（哔掉）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlUFmM54yCM7Bw2bsGUhoXi4WcXD.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>24老师与冰雕</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2270">37:50</a>：关于2024箱根驿传一百周年我们都知道什么看到了什么</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoKfxVi4GSccebcsSjeEdYZDal_1.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>帝京大学啦啦队（之一）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjCoKWErFs2A1vMAEs8fssVqUL3F.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>起点与终点：读卖新闻社</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsjBJZ1Xj2f2PS10EG-hQTDtZG9m.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>东农大名物！大根应援</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoTdiVywaHYWhyH3Am5f6m5cWZre.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>青山学院最后一棒（给水的学弟脸都笑烂了）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3304">55:04</a>: 小卢二次挑战骨折故地！滑雪初体验与越后汤泽雪场小测评</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtEh8QErKx5MLcWn2W8I_blGb43J.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>石打丸山滑雪场五星好评！</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4113">1:08:33</a>: 尔滨的热度让我最后再蹭蹭，哈尔滨冰雪大世界全是人从众𠈌</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnbipUKA_TZtaGhyCLxCBWuT45nY.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>好不容易有个喘息的空间</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4394">1:13:14</a>: 搓澡体验构成也太复杂了吧！看手法还要看打盐打醋打红酒</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fttcd24Bel3zSU_SpdsLF3VVjm6o.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>所以澡堂里为什么会有漂流啊！！</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4778">1:19:38</a>: 教皇开会。会飞的马。打架吵架。养老虎……甚至还有四川重庆串串香</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiFIEjBUZixjyuo1v5HuEeLDgHlL.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>教皇开会</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtH2Upyl1khhvGD5K0-iuZ7_8AKo.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>懒洋洋的大橘</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5268">1:27:48</a>: 温馨提示孩子们冬天可不能舔铁栏杆子啊！舔冰棍儿也小心点儿！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5614">1:33:34</a>: 下周真心话大冒险与惯例的听歌时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期出现：</span></p><span></span><p><span>动漫 - 排球少年Haikyu!!【《排球少年！！》 第1话 结束与开始-哔哩哔哩番剧】</span><a href="https://b23.tv/ep279741" data-url="https://b23.tv/ep279741"><span>b23.tv</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>小说&amp;动漫 - 强风吹拂【《强风吹拂》 第1话 第十名男子-哔哩哔哩番剧】</span><a href="https://b23.tv/ep250585" data-url="https://b23.tv/ep250585"><span>b23.tv</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>想自由 by林宥嘉</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天没回家 by陶喆</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/licmP4aoOjCk9EaRwnsQ4xpj7bbd.m4a" length="144189513" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:39:21</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZsMDNPU0RUcWFGMS1XeEJqWlN0V2J1ZkdKazcucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>&quot;体检医生在我身上完成了年度KPI&quot;｜DD002</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6599871a1519ccb103b2a3ca</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6599871a1519ccb103b2a3ca</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jan 2024 17:00:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【白日饮酒DAYDRINKING】是一个中文闲聊播客，也是用来干杯的下酒菜和同朋友保持联系的借口。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在周末，从夕阳跨越星空喝酒闲聊，记录洗澡时会悄悄溜走的妙想，逃避工作日。用【真心话】自我告解，给下一周设置【大冒险】来调剂干燥的日常。我们尽力回避尖锐，完全不讲大道理，把关注留给任何微小的快乐。希望在周末等你一起干杯，希望人和动物都能和平干杯~</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们是：</span></p><span></span><p><span>三个性格和工种截然不同，酒量参差不齐，但同样爱猫的朋友！</span></p><span></span><p><span>24：一个屋子装不下的人</span></p><span></span><p><span>考拉：即刻ID考拉茶水间，非典型互联网大厂搬砖人，每天都在期待不上班的日子</span></p><span></span><p><span>小卢：前国企程序员，从国企裸辞后在家全职陪猫猫玩，与考拉为【合法夫妻关系】</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期副标题：人和人的沟通有时候完全无用</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqnz4GyxrNWRx_lGvJJmgxyuh9ma.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="26">0:26</a>：“冰学”入门，今天的主播一个屋子都装不下</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="178">2:58</a>：淮海路上回荡着我的声音</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="212">3:32</a>：莫名其妙的排长队事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="384">6:24</a>：在be my eyes上“助人为乐”差点失败-如何在日语不好的情况下帮助日本人：让他们说英语</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="734">12:14</a>：营销人反被忽悠：体检医生在24身上完成了年度业绩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="66984">18:36:24</a>的极度“怕死”行为</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1892">31:32</a>：工作里的不同人格，你是哪种？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2209">36:49</a>：欧洲人为什么会有如此离谱的松弛感！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2405">40:05</a>：语言不通的恋爱才能持久</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2990">49:50</a>：《奇巧计程车》吹爆！社会向严肃推理神作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3291">54:51</a>: 道尾秀介和是枝裕和撞车，此《小偷家族》非彼《小偷家族》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3665">1:01:05</a>：怎么也记不起来的治郁系动画</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3875">1:04:35</a>：考拉力荐《超异能族》：内含大量剧透</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4524">1:15:24</a>：元旦计划，下次录制就是2024年啦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4670">1:17:50</a>:：《普通朋友》和《浦西朋友》，陶喆到底是什么年代的人会听的？？？</span></p><span></span><p><span>下期大冒险：</span></p><span></span><p><span>24戒烟</span></p><span></span><p><span>考拉要成为本播客的DJ</span></p>]]></description>
