  <item>
    <title>&quot;花着自己赚的钱，逃着自己选的课&quot;｜DD001</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/657eb4803d5d24e9cb4388f2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">657eb4803d5d24e9cb4388f2</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 17 Dec 2023 08:42:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【白日饮酒DAYDRINKING】是一个中文闲聊播客，也是用来干杯的下酒菜和同朋友保持联系的借口。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在周末，从夕阳跨越星空喝酒闲聊，记录洗澡时会悄悄溜走的妙想，逃避工作日。用【真心话】自我告解，给下一周设置【大冒险】来调剂干燥的日常。我们尽力回避尖锐，完全不讲大道理，把关注留给任何微小的快乐。希望在周末等你一起干杯，希望人和动物都能和平干杯~</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们是：</span></p><span></span><p><span>三个性格和工种截然不同，酒量参差不齐，但同样爱猫的朋友！</span></p><span></span><p><span>24：aka汪老师，酒量很菜但嘴硬别扭爱喝</span></p><span></span><p><span>考拉：即刻ID考拉茶水间，非典型互联网大厂搬砖人，每天都在期待不上班的日子</span></p><span></span><p><span>小卢：前国企程序员，从国企裸辞后在家全职陪猫猫玩，与考拉为【合法夫妻关系】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>—<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="290">04:50</a>: 开头就是小事故！我们仨是谁？想做怎样的一期节目？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtnPPb08YLZZ67BKS45aY3bb_ch6.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="290">04:50</a>—<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="629">10:29</a>: 人类到底是为什么那么爱聊八卦啊！但是自闭小孩除外</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="634">10:34</a>—<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1072">17:52</a>: 我们的MBTI！温馨提示乖小孩，过期的食物不要吃哦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1074">17:54</a>—<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1360">22:40</a>: 动物森友会专场！呜呜呜记错了很多名字，愧对岛上的好朋友</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvnnErR3L-BgvqyEkuVJ_ObTfNyr.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhPV1P47HeSiI7rZoG5mTjernaGr.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1361">22:41</a>—<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1837">30:37</a>: 小卢打塞尔达的酷妈妈！奥特曼与高达专场，男孩子们奇怪的胜负欲（但是最后还是说错了</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnsl8NQEmqfuyFkmpghfxoZmB9u8.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1844">30:44</a>—<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2112">35:12</a>: 所有的话都是鲁迅说的！无锡之行偶遇余华老师（bushi</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiiL1bfrGsR62KqizycrV7Z8cTSg.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2115">35:15</a>—<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2333">38:53</a>: 考拉的惯例不加班宣言！这个人真的是很烦上班了orz</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2333">38:53</a>—<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2468">41:08</a>: 所有人都有一把尘封的吉他吧，我那喜欢但又没那么有决心去再坚持一下的爱好们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2473">41:13</a>—<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2926">48:46</a>: 考拉婚后生活！猫猫们是如何接受家里新来的狗狗的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3071">51:11</a>—<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3820">1:03:40</a>: 东亚小孩是不是都有请假羞耻？成年人的课外班可怎么逃哇（另有小鱼老师四年前的vlog大放送：【VLOG 008：最后一次失忆在年末-哔哩哔哩】 </span><a href="https://b23.tv/Y74tMw6" data-url="https://b23.tv/Y74tMw6"><span>b23.tv</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3828">1:03:48</a>—<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4586">1:16:26</a>: 谁还没拧巴过几次呢？24心酸工地搬砖史，Zaza Hadid只有一个</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4586">1:16:26</a>:真心话大冒险环节！（但好像不知道为什么，成了某种告解时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span>下期的小冒险：会分享各自最近看过的剧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期出现：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Music：</span></p><span></span><p><span>陶喆 – 普通朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span>剧集：</span></p><span></span><p><span>【归来的奥特曼】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://v.qq.com/x/cover/cu4q15d3rzebjgn/s0013chhv4k.html" data-url="https://v.qq.com/x/cover/cu4q15d3rzebjgn/s0013chhv4k.html"><span>v.qq.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【泰罗·奥特曼】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://v.qq.com/x/cover/jru4jixrll5us91/i0016aq34ar.html" data-url="https://v.qq.com/x/cover/jru4jixrll5us91/i0016aq34ar.html"><span>v.qq.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【机动战士高达00：第1话 天人】 </span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/bangumi/play/ep35127/?share_source=copy_web" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/bangumi/play/ep35127/?share_source=copy_web"><span>www.bilibili.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【机动战士高达SEED HD：第1话 虚假的和平】 </span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/bangumi/play/ep39916/?share_source=copy_web" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/bangumi/play/ep39916/?share_source=copy_web"><span>www.bilibili.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【万神殿 第一季 Pantheon Season 1 (2022)】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/34990593/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/34990593/"><span>movie.douban.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>以及：</span></p><span></span><p><span>【VLOG 008：最后一次失忆在年末-哔哩哔哩】 </span><a href="https://b23.tv/Y74tMw6" data-url="https://b23.tv/Y74tMw6"><span>b23.tv</span></a></p>]]></description>
